# =============================================================================
# Pulsar OS - Minimal Debian Package List
# =============================================================================
# Stripped-down list for lightweight ISO (~2-3GB compressed target).
# Heavy optional apps (Docker, VM tools, multimedia, compatibility apps)
# are installed on-demand by Welcome OOTB or recovery.
# =============================================================================

